  "releaseNotes": "1.1.0 — safer residency defaults: the resident video VAE decoder is off by default to avoid the multi-hour-per-step VRAM-thrash path on consecutive generations; KeepDit stays on. Adds H3RuntimeOptions.VaePath health hint. 1.0.0 — per-component model paths, first/last frame and reference conditioning, native runtimes for win-x64 and linux-x64.",
